        {"zh": "盯着你的伤口流血", "en": "Stare at your bleeding wound"},
        {"zh": "腿骨错位，还在往前冲。", "en": "My leg bone is out of place, and I keep running."},
        {"zh": "跑起来比走还难看。", "en": "My run looks worse than my walk."}
      ]
    },
